    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034750/extras/f42097d43df98cff3d0f8353ee66f8cb.avif?t=1752770297\" width=616 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frog Holm is a story-driven game about strange encounters, quiet moments, and the mysteries of a remote island life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034750/extras/cd0b4bb956c3c7362d780e9f61d95deb.avif?t=1752770297\" width=616 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop into the shoes a young frog, who unexpectedly ends up running a small island bar. What starts as a quiet life among drinks and simple conversations quickly turns into a mysterious story, waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The islands surrounding your pub are home to an odd but tight-knit community, full of quirky personalities and hidden tensions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, you explore lovingly crafted environments, uncover secrets, and gather fresh ingredients. By night, you serve cocktails and listen to the stories of the islanders - slowly piecing together a larger mystery that connects them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034750/extras/ea04cd3b3034192c59e69cdbb105dea7.avif?t=1752770297\" width=616 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034750/extras/f42097d43df98cff3d0f8353ee66f8cb.avif?t=1752770297\" width=616 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frog Holm is a story-driven game about strange encounters, quiet moments, and the mysteries of a remote island life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034750/extras/cd0b4bb956c3c7362d780e9f61d95deb.avif?t=1752770297\" width=616 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop into the shoes a young frog, who unexpectedly ends up running a small island bar. What starts as a quiet life among drinks and simple conversations quickly turns into a mysterious story, waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The islands surrounding your pub are home to an odd but tight-knit community, full of quirky personalities and hidden tensions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, you explore lovingly crafted environments, uncover secrets, and gather fresh ingredients. By night, you serve cocktails and listen to the stories of the islanders - slowly piecing together a larger mystery that connects them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034750/extras/ea04cd3b3034192c59e69cdbb105dea7.avif?t=1752770297\" width=616 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
